		)
		(uuid "8d4756a3-23be-40c2-a318-98bebc270d5a")
	)
	(text "Rows: active-low open-drain (unselected rows high impedance).\nColumns: input pull-ups; EXTI 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,14,15 are all distinct.\nSleep: all rows low; a pressed key pulls a column low through its diode.\nPA9 and PA10 use dedicated package pins 19/21; do not enable PA11/12 remap.\nPA15 TIM2_CH1 can generate RGB data. PC14/15 remain inputs, no LSE.\nSet nBOOT_SEL=0 for external BOOT0. The main MCU must tri-state KB_BOOT0 for SWD.\nR11 limits accidental contention; PA14 is shared BOOT0/SWCLK, not a separate GPIO.\nUSART2: PA2=TX to main UART_RX; PA3=RX from main UART_TX. SWO is absent on Cortex-M0+."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d720a928-e418-4851-958b-b16b21762b04")
	)
